$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=recipsumlem1  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for recipsum: for a prime p >= w >= 2, 1 / p <= ( Lam(p) / p ) / log w.

1::simp1    |- ( ( w e. ( ZZ>= ` 2 ) /\ p e. Prime /\ w <_ p ) -> w e. ( ZZ>= ` 2 ) )
