9:1,9a:syl  |- ( ( w e. ( ZZ>= ` 2 ) /\ p e. Prime /\ w <_ p ) -> 1 < w )
10:4:nnred  |- ( ( w e. ( ZZ>= ` 2 ) /\ p e. Prime /\ w <_ p ) -> w e. RR )
